  dct:description "The purpose of this procurement is to award Framework Agreements to a maximum of three service providers for the purchase and renewal of specific hardware and software products used in the IT Security domain (supplied by various third-party vendors) and for the provision of ad-hoc advisory and consultancy support related to the purchased hardware and software products."@en;
